silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_01_sections_03_concrete_anchor_2#stagendiagram silm:hasLongDescription "The StageNDiagram is the stage-n source diagram. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'D_Mittens^n', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
